The October 2026 meeting of LRUG will be on *Monday the 12th of October*,
from _6:00pm_ to _8:00pm_ (meeting starts at _6:30pm_).  The venue this
month is provided by [Cleo](https://web.meetcleo.com/careers)
and is in [their offices][cleo-venue], on Finsbury Sq. (between Moorgate & Liverpool St tube stations).  [Full venue
and registration details are given below](#october26registration).

